WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.690
- It's amazing how people can't
differentiate between say,

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.080
the narrow AI that allows a car

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.730
to figure out what a lane line is

00:00:17.347 --> 00:00:22.030
and navigate streets versus
general intelligence.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.470
These are just very different things.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:27.160
Like your toaster and your
computer are both machines,

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.617
but one is much more
sophisticated than another.

00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:32.800
- You're confident with
Tesla you can create

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.980
the world's best toaster?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.260
- The world's best toaster, yes.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.240
The world's best self-driving...

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:46.017
Yes, to me, right now
this seems game, set, match.

00:00:47.295 --> 00:00:49.088
I don't wanna be complacent
or over confident

00:00:49.088 --> 00:00:54.010
but that is just literally
how it appears right now.

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.690
I could be wrong but it
appears to be the case

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.983
that Tesla is vastly ahead of everyone.

